      "spam": false,
      "value": "@{59b9b46ce46c3651b53cf85e|full_name}: I have noticed a marked increase in the size of the instance numbers, most are three and four digits now. I wonder if that's a side effect of this issue.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    }
